v 3
d 'DATEFIX': module to convert string date variables to numeric date formatted variables
d See {bf:help datefix} after installation.
d
d Parses string dates into Stata numeric daily dates.
d Supports explicit or auto-detected date order, numeric-date passthrough,
d custom display formats, and diagnostics for unconvertible values.
d
d Requires: Stata version 16 or higher.
d
d KW: Stata
d KW: date
d KW: string
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260809
d
d License: MIT
d
d Author: Timothy P Copeland, Karolinska Institutet
d
f datefix.ado
f datefix.sthlp
d
